    "description": "<p>So Speaks Adorjan permanently alters the costs and mechanics of the Infernal's Adorjan Excellency suite. The First Adorjan Excellency now provides two dice per mote spent rather than one, and the Second Adorjan Excellency now provides one automatic success per mote spent rather than one per two motes. Adorjan Inevitability Technique no longer requires a Willpower expenditure, costing four motes instead. So Speaks Adorjan is incompatible with Effortless Adorjan Dominance.</p>",
